Cell["\<\
{1,2,3} {4,5} {6,7,8}
notice that l7, l8 are suspicious poles. To eliminate the spurious poles, we \
may further reduce the size. (there is further redundancy in the integral \
repr. of Hankel function)
6 = 1 + (2+1) + (1+1)\
\>", "Text",
